WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.136
While Emperor Wen of Song, Liu Yilong, was on the throne, the Liu Song state was strong, and the whole court was full of confidence.

00:00:08.486 --> 00:00:14.750
The emperor sent armies north many times, hoping to recover the lost lands south of the Yellow River.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.348
The generals and soldiers were in high spirits, all wanting to recover the lost territory.

00:00:19.698 --> 00:00:25.002
But the northern expedition of the year 450 was very inadequately prepared.

00:00:25.352 --> 00:00:30.296
After the Song army pushed deep into the north, it was counterattacked by the Northern Wei army and lost the battle.

00:00:30.646 --> 00:00:35.518
The Northern Wei cavalry came fast and fierce, and the Song army could not hold against them.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:42.996
This defeat brought heavy losses, and from then on Song no longer had the strength for another large-scale northern expedition.

00:00:43.346 --> 00:00:48.602
The fine state of the Yuanjia era was thus gradually lost.

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:57.736
Later, people used the words 'Yuanjia haste' to remind everyone: when preparations are lacking, never send out troops rashly.

00:00:58.086 --> 00:01:01.950
Before any great undertaking, one must first prepare well.

